  - { name: "Sense Supernatural Beings", description: "Works like Sense Psychic and Magic Energy but is far more sensitive. Base Skill: 62% +2% per level to identify the specific type or race of paranormal creature (alien intelligences, gods, demigods, demons, vampires, dragons) and to tell whether a person is possessed. Tracking by this scent: 35% +5% per level, or 70% +3% per level if the being is also using psionics or magic. Range: 100 feet (30.5 m) per level for a being not using its powers; 1000 feet (305 m) +100 feet (30.5 m) per additional level when powers or magic are in use. Automatic and constant; no I.S.P. Close proximity to ley lines and nexus points disrupts it." }
  - { name: "Sense of Smell (reduced for the Sea Dog)", description: "The Sea Dog''s sense of smell and tracking by scent are -20% against the standard Dog Boy figures, which are: common and strong scents 70% +3% per level, range 100 feet (30.5 m) per level; identify specific odors 54% +2% per level, range 25 feet (7.6 m) per level; track by smell alone 40% +4% per level. With the penalty that is 50%, 34% and 20% at the same per-level rates. Follows a trail up to four days (96 hours) old if it has not been washed away, and smells odors up to 12 inches (0.3 m) underground or two feet (0.6 m) under snow. Roll once per 1000 feet (305 m), half that on a light scent or in light rain or snow; a failed roll loses the trail for the moment, two successes in three tries find it again, two failures lose it. Cannot track through water, nor smell Astral Beings, ghosts or energy beings. Suffers only half the normal penalties to strike, parry and dodge when blinded or in total darkness." }
  - { name: "Keen Sense of Hearing", description: "Hears sounds up to 35,000 vibrations per second against a human''s 20,000. The ears swivel to fix on a noise and the inner ear can shut out background din." }
