  - { name: "Endurance", description: "Twice a human''s when resisting fatigue and lifting weight. A P.S. under 17 carries 20 times P.S. in pounds, 17 or higher carries 40 times, and the character lifts twice what it carries. Works at an intense, even pace for two hours before fatigue, or 40 minutes of all-out exertion; recovers in about 15 minutes of rest or light work." }
  - { name: "Sensitivity to Ley Line Energy", description: "On a ley line or near a nexus the psychic and supernatural sensing abilities are impaired or blotted out; ordinary senses are unaffected and the other Sensitive powers are enhanced as usual. Ley Line Storms cause headaches, crackling in the ears and static shocks, and the character is twice as likely to be struck by ley line energy and lightning." }
  - { name: "Psionics and I.S.P.", description: "Effectively a master psionic: needs a 10 or higher to save vs psionic attack. Automatically has Sense Evil, Sense Magic, Sixth Sense and Empathy (receiver only, not transmission), plus one more Sensitive power of choice. I.S.P.: M.E. attribute number plus 1D6x10, +10 per additional level. Recovers 2 I.S.P. per hour of activity or 12 per hour of meditation or sleep." }
  - { name: "Size and Life Span", description: "About 190 lbs (85.5 kg), mostly muscle; 5 ft 9 in to 6 ft 3 in (1.7 to 1.82 m). Thick waist and bulky build, coarse flat oily fur in black, chocolate brown or white with black markings, broad webbed hands and feet, human legs and a bushy tail. Human speech partial to full. Lives 32 to 45 years; females 10 years longer." }
